that of 32 aliphatic
alcohols (ROH) (carbon atom number range C<sub>4</sub>–C<sub>20</sub>).</p></div></div></div><div id="fig6" content-id="fig6" class="fig fig-modal reveal-modal" data-reveal="data-reveal"><div class="fig-label fig-label">Figure 6</div><div class="graphic-wrap"><a class="fig-link" href="/view-large/figure/164934665/ao3c06992_0006.svg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-describedby="sr-fig-viewer-action"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/8/51/10.1021_acsomega.3c06992/3/m_ao3c06992_0006.svg?Expires=1791347250&amp;Signature=bOvZRYJ9ANWpjly9kVTnWZWGiCuxpuyfTh9YofgSYZ1MJR3etWLp89VLfj3QuVgHQxuCOED3lzALtGQWzo~qsLk7IM7MvJRknv-hsmabFHHdMJQKMF-rBygE-R4h3UKGJyqxh~b0Z4JGiY6vmKDBtdMe-1JbE7O5tANNlqz0YdOWogUFZeGWYYdKxeN6yXFyyt0GJPF6EOhJs10CeokjcTW15dIMHRo0pQH5m-Yv03gGCQCS8~u4OMXw5w88JUlVJP9UKxBLg-6VZE3AUZK9V0srN5zDmoXGnVSF8sjxJORSwWXZheJO9kDSL5Wg3SK2BeRP3Ar93btpNZqGhJHLjA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/8/51/10.1021_acsomega.3c06992/3/m_ao3c06992_0006.svg?Expires=1791347250&amp;Signature=bOvZRYJ9ANWpjly9kVTnWZWGiCuxpuyfTh9YofgSYZ1MJR3etWLp89VLfj3QuVgHQxuCOED3lzALtGQWzo~qsLk7IM7MvJRknv-hsmabFHHdMJQKMF-rBygE-R4h3UKGJyqxh~b0Z4JGiY6vmKDBtdMe-1JbE7O5tANNlqz0YdOWogUFZeGWYYdKxeN6yXFyyt0GJPF6EOhJs10CeokjcTW15dIMHRo0pQH5m-Yv03gGCQCS8~u4OMXw5w88JUlVJP9UKxBLg-6VZE3AUZK9V0srN5zDmoXGnVSF8sjxJORSwWXZheJO9kDSL5Wg3SK2BeRP3Ar93btpNZqGhJHLjA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Figure 6. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao3c06992_0006.svg" /></a><div class="fig-orig original-slide"><a section="164934665" class="fig-view-orig at-figureViewLarge" role="button" href="/view-large/figure/164934665/ao3c06992_0006.svg" path-from-xml="ao3c06992_0006.svg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Figure 6.">View Large</a><a section="164934665" href="//acs.silverchair-cdn.com/DownloadFile/DownloadImage.aspx?image=https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/8/51/10.1021_acsomega.3c06992/3/ao3c06992_0006.svg?Expires=1791347250&Signature=idpshbm-7J~tRzF5aiEzk-QY4r6EzNK1b2oeCYR4ctPAOgLX~EymiZLsVCT9jLYkyQoiUeDegdxeyg6Z5ZjJNxpuPfv4j67shPorjfkeLKaqlizpfBWV6LSsCsoYLv3dlszghXPvpREokjw1uqkAXWlgCFwtEeAqyfYacsxGjdoXJhHekORCK8P-mtiBzt5wxQZmkqAEp4~bW8juC7X6LAeKFU6mX0nmpYgPve8AyO73N5PgfH46X3vAoWY3EYDqZLh2KQf~28~HdDBEOmI9BEg~3NdzpV7ado5WuPY1niFg8wA7s-kBfbsCynwMxepAnbn5bCMYbWmj31U1vPsyjw__&Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA&sec=164934665&ar=341563&xsltPath=~/UI/app/XSLT&imagename=&siteId=1000073" class="download-slide stats-download-slide js-download-file-gtm-datalayer-event" role="button" data-filetype="ppt" path-from-xml="ao3c06992_0006.svg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="Download slide for Figure 6.">Download to Slide</a></div></div><div class="graphic-bottom"><div class="label fig-label">Figure 6.</div><div class="caption fig-caption"><p>Plot of experimental boiling points <em>T</em><sub>b</sub> of 32 primary amines (RNH<sub>2</sub>) versus
that of 32 aliphatic
alcohols (ROH) (carbon atom number range C<sub>4</sub>–C<sub>20</sub>).</p></div></div><a class="close-reveal-modal" href="javascript:;"><i class="icon-general-close" aria-hidden="true"> </i><span class="screenreader-text">Close Figure 6.</span></a></div>
                </div>
                <div id="164934666-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="164934658">
                    
                    <p>When we plotted the predicted
boiling point (<em>T</em><sub>b, pred</sub>) values of
primary amines against the experimental
boiling point values (<em>T</em><sub>b, exp</sub>) of
aliphatic alcohols, (<a href="javascript:;" ref-data-modal-source-id="ref20" class="link link-ref xref-bibr js-link-ref">20</a>) we still obtained
a good linear relationship (as shown in <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="fig7" data-open="fig7" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Figure 7</a>). From the slopes and intercepts of <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="fig6" data-open="fig6" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Figures 6</a> and <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="fig7" data-open="fig7" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">7</a>, it can be seen that the predicted boiling point values of
primary amines in this article are reliable.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="164934667-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="164934658">
                    
                    <a id = "164934667" scrollto-destination="164934667"></a><div data-id="fig7" class="fig fig-section" reveal-group-id="sec2.2.3"><span class="hidden" id="viewTranscriptId_"></span><div class="fig-label fig-label">Figure 7</div><div class="graphic-wrap"><a class="fig-link" href="/view-large/figure/164934667/ao3c06992_0007.svg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-describedby="sr-fig-viewer-action"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/8/51/10.1021_acsomega.3c06992/3/m_ao3c06992_0007.svg?Expires=1791347250&amp;Signature=FMxSOipdQiPbVWOatj4uZrtrjOvWByhtAnZ0oNu0lj7XkRiRFZBRT5pobLKTxWc6De-AZhrfBeWvHoEG6~i15EmPEt4WeYhP6t4PIvuvpL7VsDWfjLe73yT61iinmTvRtrYnZ~T-lwiOhVoXNBz1wsa4u6ckWZ1-0z9pjo1iVvfB4F7Mx7Zwm2t09Q~8O~2l1Nz49axkAUcLrPe1IhQYf2jHe9QC82Ybyxl~5PzU287RtrgZa48yrcphoCzRP4PmUp1DwOi-cCG3B3-V0SKJcDxVAQgKiY1hOBQNF32kjhaj4gUyCpIV7K4K7jr6G8yfzzhSQCClmoZbZRMzZ0XKIA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/8/51/10.1021_acsomega.3c06992/3/m_ao3c06992_0007.svg?Expires=1791347250&amp;Signature=FMxSOipdQiPbVWOatj4uZrtrjOvWByhtAnZ0oNu0lj7XkRiRFZBRT5pobLKTxWc6De-AZhrfBeWvHoEG6~i15EmPEt4WeYhP6t4PIvuvpL7VsDWfjLe73yT61iinmTvRtrYnZ~T-lwiOhVoXNBz1wsa4u6ckWZ1-0z9pjo1iVvfB4F7Mx7Zwm2t09Q~8O~2l1Nz49axkAUcLrPe1IhQYf2jHe9QC82Ybyxl~5PzU287RtrgZa48yrcphoCzRP4PmUp1DwOi-cCG3B3-V0SKJcDxVAQgKiY1hOBQNF32kjhaj4gUyCpIV7K4K7jr6G8yfzzhSQCClmoZbZRMzZ0XKIA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Figure 7. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao3c06992_0007.svg" /></a><div class="fig-orig original-slide"><a section="164934667" class="fig-view-orig at-figureViewLarge" role="button" href="/view-large/figure/164934667/ao3c06992_0007.svg" path-from-xml="ao3c06992_0007.svg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Figure 7.">View Large</a><a section="164934667" href="//acs.silverchair-cdn.com/Download